cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fmri-qa in published work, please cite this software."
title: "fmri-qa"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Phantom fMRI quality assurance, distributed as three packages: fmri-qa-core
  (metrics and the analysis artifact), fmri-qa-report (plots and a
  self-contained HTML report), and fmri-qa-launcher (a one-step DICOM-in,
  report-out application shell).
authors:
  - family-names: "Storrs"
    given-names: "Judd"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
